  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Emperor City, Ancient Soul Sect’s Frost Dragon Manor stands as the right-side garden among Immortal Gu Houses defending the city. Together with Yue Yang Palace it charges Bai Ning Bing and the rest, destroys their house’s killer move, and later lands its own killer move that breaks part of Fang Yuan’s Immortal Gu House.",
      "chapters": [
        1708
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_emperor_city",
        "fac_ancient_soul_sect",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_yue_yang_palace",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Frost Dragon Manor is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment of Ancient Soul Sect, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Emperor City falls, Frost Dragon Manor and Wind Sweeping Building arrive as reinforcements with their Gu Immortals. Frost Dragon Manor leads, shines in light blue aura that forms a hornless dragon, and shoots hailstones at Ba Shi Ba. Under his killer moves its walls crack and tiles fly; a second light blue hornless dragon then coils with the first around the house, raising defense and shooting a tattered mysterious light that Ba Shi Ba reads as power to expel his killer move’s damage.",
      "chapters": [
        1731
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reinforcement-combat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_wind_sweeping_building",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_ba_shi_ba"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside that formation, Frost Dragon Manor ramps with Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building, Wind Sweeping Building, and other Immortal Gu Houses, colliding and erupting with immortal killer moves amid the rank eight fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1734
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-exterior",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_clear_jade_dripping_wind_tiny_bamboo_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ye Fan later names Frost Dragon Manor among Immortal Gu Houses floating over Emperor City, again as Ancient Soul Sect’s house: an exquisitely built garden, grand with white jade tiles, oozing cold air, with faint dragon roars.",
      "chapters": [
        1931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ye-fan-listing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Central Continent’s side, Frost Dragon Manor emits dragon soul and frost energy while Yue Yang Palace and Wind Sweeping Building press the field.",
      "chapters": [
        1932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "frost-energy-combat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thousand Transformations Ancestor charges alone with transformation path killer moves and forces back Yue Yang Palace and Frost Dragon Manor.",
      "chapters": [
        1937
      ],
